### 🔍 Summary of new functions

| Function                       | Description                                |
| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |
| `compute_itgt_for_row(row_id)` | Converts DE5 row torque → target current   |
| `run_current_pi(dt_s)`         | Real-time PI loop; clamps integral/output  |
| `de5_set_pi_gains(kp, ki)`     | UART-callable tuning                       |
| `I_target`                     | Dynamic current target (A)                 |
| `I_integrator`                 | Integral state of PI controller            |
| Safety                         | Stops on overcurrent or overtemp instantly |

